BEHAVIOR build-post

DESCRIPTION
  Builds an HTTP/1.1 POST request into req: the fixed 56-byte header from
  post-header, then the first body_len bytes of body copied in after it.
  req_len is header_len + body_len.

CONTRACT
  INPUT body bytes 65536
  INPUT body_len int 8
  OUTPUT req bytes 65536
  OUTPUT req_len int 8
  REQUIRES post-header@cd8db959 copy@05c62b49 add-int@506d7b8d
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 1ed7a538

COMPOSITION
  h = CALL post-header
  ch = CALL copy h.hdr 0 req 0 56
  DISCARD ch.bytes_copied
  cp = CALL copy body 0 req 56 body_len
  DISCARD cp.bytes_copied
  rl = CALL add-int 56 body_len
  SET req_len rl.result
END
